          "explanation": "The doctor asked targeted medication timing and dose questions.",
          "quote": "甲氨蝶呤每次剂量及最后一次服药时间"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00053",
          "explanation": "The family revealed uncertainty about dose and timing.",
          "quote": "最后一次到底哪天吃的我现在真说不准"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "partial",
