          "quote": "大小那一栏我没完全看清"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00086",
          "explanation": "The doctor specified which CT details to verify and tied urgency to current symptoms.",
          "quote": "CT检查日期、结节所在肺叶、最大直径"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "HO3 was completed for the ambiguous lung report: the doctor did not overcall it as emergent, required verification of date/size/solid component and current symptoms, and used those facts to set follow-up urgency.",
      "ho_id": "HO3",
      "meaningful_trajectory_impact": true,
      "triggered": true
    },
    {
