          "explanation": "The doctor set a conditional pathway: no current danger signs meant urgent outpatient rheumatology rather than ER.",
          "quote": "今晚通常可先不去急诊"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00065",
          "explanation": "The doctor gave escalation triggers if symptoms changed.",
          "quote": "若出现发热、膝盖迅速红热肿痛或不能负重"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "HO4 was completed: the doctor dynamically prioritized rheumatology/medication safety when no acute signs were present, while preserving immediate escalation for fever, severe joint worsening, respiratory symptoms, or severe drug reaction.",
      "ho_id": "HO4",
      "meaningful_trajectory_impact": true,
      "triggered": true
    }
  ],
  "important_non_chain_defect_assessment": {
